# Generated map output. Named directories only — a blanket *.html rule has
# three times hidden files the package needs (inst/controls/time-slider.html,
# so a fresh clone could not build a map; dev/concepts/.../examples, the only
# evidence retired ideas worked; vignettes/maps, the manual's own examples).
# Ignore where output lands, not what it is called.
aq_maps/

# pkgdown site: built locally, served from GitHub Pages once deployed.
# Kept out of the repo until then — see dev/260707_manual_prospectus_v1.md.
docs/

# Downloaded package tarballs kept for reference, not ours to version
dev/*.tgz

